# utilitye2e-ai

Open-source E2E test generator — AI analyzes your DB schema + natural language, generates and runs CRUD tests with Playwright.

## How it works

```
Natural Language + DB Schema
        ↓ (LLM)
   Test Spec (JSON)
        ↓ (Form UI — optional tuning)
   Playwright Runner
        ↓
   Test Report
```

The **Test Spec** is the central contract: a human-readable, editable JSON that describes what to test. The AI generates it; you can review and tweak it; the runner executes it. Specs can be saved, shared, and version-controlled.

## Quick start

```bash
# Install
pip install -e .

# Configure
cp config.example.yaml config.yaml
# Edit config.yaml — set your DB, LLM provider, target URL

# Run Web UI
utilitye2e-ai web

# Or use CLI directly
utilitye2e-ai analyze --description "測試家長管理的新增、編輯、刪除" --table parents
utilitye2e-ai run --spec spec.json
```

## Architecture

```
core/
├── spec.py        # TestSpec dataclass (the contract)
├── runner.py      # Playwright execution engine
└── recorder.py    # Test result recorder

adapters/
├── schema/        # DB abstraction (PostgreSQL, SQLite, Manual)
└── llm/           # LLM abstraction (GLM, OpenAI, Ollama)

ai/
├── analyzer.py    # NL + schema → TestSpec
└── prompts.py     # System prompts

web/               # Flask SPA (AI Dialog + Spec Form + Reports)
cli.py             # CLI entry point
config.yaml        # User configuration
```

### Three pluggable layers

| Layer | Responsibility | Built-in | Extensible to |
|-------|---------------|----------|--------------|
| **SchemaAdapter** | Read table/column info | PostgreSQL, SQLite, Manual JSON | MySQL, etc. |
| **LLMAdapter** | Analyze NL → TestSpec | GLM (z.ai), OpenAI, Ollama (local) | Any provider |
| **TestSpec** | Test description (JSON) | CRUD actions, field mapping | Workflows, visual regression |

## Test Spec format (MVP)

```json
{
  "name": "家長管理 CRUD 測試",
  "target": {
    "url": "http://localhost:3001/t/ctb-premium-demo/ctb/parents",
    "login_url": "http://localhost:3001/login",
    "auth": { "username": "admin", "password": "admin" }
  },
  "table": "plugin_ctb_parents",
  "actions": ["add_cancel", "add_save", "edit_cancel", "delete"],
  "fields": [
    { "name": "name", "label": "家長姓名", "selector": "input[name='name']",
      "value": "測試家長", "required": true },
    { "name": "phone", "label": "電話", "selector": "input[name='phone']",
      "value": "0912345678" }
  ],
  "ui": {
    "add_button": "新增家長",
    "modal_title_regex": "新增家長",
    "save_button": "儲存",
    "cancel_button": "取消"
  }
}
```

## Configuration

See `config.example.yaml` for all options.

